{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1107292-ghoul-retainers","id":1107292,"title":"Ghoul Retainers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-24T06:09:43-07:00","id":1107292,"title":"Ghoul Retainers","content":"what does &quot; add a dot of the regnant\u2019s Disciplines for a one- or two-dot Retainer, a second dot for a three- or four-dot Retainer, and a third dot for a five-dot Retainer.&quot; Does that mean you add those dots to the cost?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4045-princeofcincinnati","name":"princeofcincinnati","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-24T07:21:07-07:00","id":1107303,"title":"","content":"I translate it to mean the ghoul retainer has those disciplines respectively based on their retainer rating to their regnant.<br /> <br /> If it's an NPC ghoul retainer to an NPC kindred I ignore this entirely. I don't use book preset XP values on NPCs. I build them based on story need.<br /> If the ghoul is a PC's retainer and an NPC, the PC can add one dot from their &quot;in clan&quot; discipline spread to their retainer if its 1-2 dot in addition to the starting one dot physical they get at ghoul creation. Scaling up with the merit accordingly.<br /> If the ghoul retainer is a PC to an NPC kindred, AT CHARACTER CREATION ONLY I let them choose 1-3 disciplines from the kindred's entire discipline spread as available for them to purchase based on whatever retainer rating they chose for that regnant as mentor, and the NPC has them as a retainer at that equal rank.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-25T07:56:02-07:00","id":1107634,"title":"","content":"A 1-2 dot retainer gainsba dot in a discipline that the regent knows.<br /> <br /> A 3-4 dot retainer gains 2 dots in disciplines.<br /> <br /> A 5 dot retainer gains 3 dots in disciplines.<br /> <br /> These Disciplins are Free and in addition to the normal rules for retainers. Ghoul retainers do not otherwise have disciplines, and one starting physical discipline isn't a thijg in 2e. The disciplines granted need to be known by the regent, but they do not need to be in-clan. This makes a Kindred's Ghoul retainers particularpy potent.<br /> <br /> For instance, if the Regent knows Vigor 3 and they buy a 3-dot retainer. They could give that Ghoul Vigor 2, meaning they would roll 3 x 2 (normal retainer dicepool) + 2 (bonus Strength from Vigor) = 8 dice to punch people, with the ability to spend blood on Vigor's effects.<br /> <br /> As for how much derived traits a Retainer has, the book is silent. I personally go for &quot;the relevant trait = Retainer dots,&quot; so a three dot retainer can store 3 Blood, has 8 Health Levels, and 6 Defense (assuming they are a combat-y retainer, 3 defense otherwise), 6 Initiatice, 11 Speed, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1157,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","user":"SoulGambit","date":". 06-25-2017, 11:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-25T18:02:13-07:00","id":1107829,"title":"","content":"Thanks! that clears it up.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4045-princeofcincinnati","name":"princeofcincinnati","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4045_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}